<title>UK: UK firms see no threat from Labour - paper.</title>
<headline>UK firms see no threat from Labour - paper.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>A majority of British businesses believe a change of government would make little or no difference to their prospects, according to a survey by Reed Personnel Services published by the Times on Monday.</p>
<p>The recruitment specialist surveyed 748 businesses and found 63 percent said a change would make no difference, said the paper.</p>
<p>Fifteen percent said they would be more successful under Labour, it added.</p>
<p>- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
